WEBVTT

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:04.760
Using the pandemic of COVID-19 to set the
epidemiological context,

00:00:04.790 --> 00:00:09.180
we conducted scenario analyses to examine
the relationship between

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:13.900
reduced infection risk and increased
energy cost incurred from improved

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:18.860
ventilation in 111,485 public

00:00:18.890 --> 00:00:20.910
and private schools in the U.S.
